Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:46:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1077/3799] soh: rename D_8014A6C0 -> gAudioTatumInit

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: const s16 pair whose second element is gTatumsPerBeat (variables.h defines that macro as element 1) and whose first the file marks "// unused"; named for the one identified member because nothing else pins down what the pair is.
Defined in soh/src/code/audio_init_params.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/include/variables.h          | 4 ++--
 soh/src/code/audio_init_params.c | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/include/variables.h b/soh/include/variables.h
index b620e1a74..acddc0110 100644
